{
  "summary": "The experiment tested an image-only multiprofile model using resnet50, achieving validation accuracy of 0.3275 and F1 of 0.288, significantly lower than RNA-only baselines (e.g., 0.65). This suggests image data may not contribute meaningfully in this setting, but the role of aggregation and fusion methods remains uncertain without further comparisons. The result isolates image modality impact but does not address interactions with RNA data or alternative encoders."
}

